    controlsSub: "シリンダー内超臨界CO2注入圧力、溶融樹脂温度、CO2注入率、スクリュー回転数、水分率、ダイ急減圧速度（dP/dt）、CO2循環回収を設定。",
    systemLabel: "SCFX 押出機機構＆バレルユニット:",
    systemHelp: "産業用同方向回転二軸押出機、高トルク噛み合い異方向反応機、クリーンルーム用パイロット機、遊星ローラー式連続押出機から選択。",
    feedstockLabel: "熱失活性バイオ原料 / 食品マトリクス:",
    feedstockHelp: "エンドウ豆/ソラマメ単離タンパク質、β-グルカン高含有オート麦、ブルーベリーアントシアニン＆海洋性コラーゲン、天然ホエイ＆プロバイオティクス、強化離乳食から選択。",
    pressureLabel: "超臨界CO2バレル注入圧力 (P_scCO2):",
    pressureHelp: "バレル混合ゾーンへ直接注入されるCO2圧力（80〜280 bar）。高圧ほど高分子溶融体への溶解度と核生成過飽和度が向上。",
    tempLabel: "バレル・ダイ溶融生地温度 (T_barrel):",
    tempHelp: "ダイ吐出直前の生地実測温度（40〜125°C）。SCFXは70°C以下の極低温で高膨化を実現し、熱変性とアクリルアミド生成を根絶。",
    co2DoseLabel: "超臨界CO2微細発泡注入比率 (w_CO2):",
    co2DoseHelp: "原料供給流量に対する scCO2 注入質量比率（0.2〜3.5 wt%）。高分子可塑化と多孔セル膨張を司る。",
    screwSpeedLabel: "押出スクリュー回転数 (N_screw):",
    screwSpeedHelp: "スクリューの回転速度（100〜450 RPM）。生地剪断速度、滞留時間、比機械エネルギー（SME）を決定。",
    moistureLabel: "原料仕込み水分率 (M_feed):",
    moistureHelp: "水分添加後の湿潤基準水分率（15〜30 wt%）。糊化度とガラス転移境界を左右。",
    dpdtLabel: "ダイオリフィス急減圧速度 (dP/dt):",
    dpdtHelp: "ダイ微細孔通過時の圧力開放速度（1.0〜5.0 GPa/s）。急激な減圧が爆発的な均一微細気泡核生成を誘発。",
    recoveryLabel: "クローズドループ scCO2 真空捕集＆再液化圧縮回収:",
    recoveryHelp: "膨張放出したCO2ガスの95%以上を液化再圧縮して循環利用し、コストと環境負荷を低減。",
    presetsTitle: "高効率商業生産プリセット",
    presetPeaProtein: "植物性微細多孔質エンドウ豆ミートモード (180 bar, 65°C, 2.0% CO2, 280 RPM, 24% 水分)",
    presetOatBetaGlucan: "全粒オート麦β-グルカン機能性クリスプモード (150 bar, 72°C, 1.6% CO2, 250 RPM, 20% 水分)",
    presetAnthocyaninCollagen: "野生ベリーアントシアニン＆コラーゲン美肌スナックモード (210 bar, 52°C, 2.4% CO2, 300 RPM, 22% 水分)",
    presetProbioticCereal: "活性プロバイオティクス高含有ホエイシリアルモード (160 bar, 48°C, 2.2% CO2, 220 RPM, 26% 水分)",
    presetHazard: "熱劣化焦げ付き＆CO2不足セル崩壊ハザード警告モード (80 bar, 125°C, 0.4% CO2, 420 RPM, 15% 水分)",
    diagnosticTitle: "連続 SCFX プロセステレメトリ＆品質指標",
    diagnosticSub: "断面膨化倍率（SEI）、微小気泡核生成密度、平均孔径、熱失活性成分残存率、比機械エネルギー（SME）、溶融粘度低下率をリアルタイム算出。",
    expansionRatioLabel: "断面膨化倍率指数 (SEI / ER):",
    cellDensityLabel: "微小気泡核生成密度 (N_cell):",
    poreDiameterLabel: "平均微細孔セル径 (d_pore):",
    retainedBioactivityLabel: "生理活性物質＆抗酸化能残存率:",
    smeLabel: "単位比機械エネルギー (SME):",
    viscosityReductionLabel: "溶融生地可塑化粘度低下率:",
    voidFractionLabel: "独立気泡ボイド率 (ε_void):",
    overallStatusLabel: "SCFX プロセス妥当性＆品質総合評価:",
    diagramTitle: "連続式超臨界流体押出成形全系統図",
    diagramSub: "高圧scCO2注入、二軸混練バレル、微小ダイ均一微細発泡、CO2循環回収ループを可視化。",
    scienceTitle: "科学的基礎: 超臨界微細発泡＆非加熱テクスチャリング工学",
    scienceSub: "ヘンリーの法則に基づくscCO2溶解、爆発的均一核生成機構、自由体積理論による可塑化、アレニウス熱失活動力学、3-A 45-03衛生基準適合性。",
    tableTitle: "超臨界 SCFX と従来の産業用押出技術の総合比較"
  }
};

const d = DICT[lang] || DICT.en;
---

<div class="space-y-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8" id="scfx-modeler-app">
  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <header class="space-y-4 text-center sm:text-left border-b border-hairline/60 pb-8">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-800">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      {d.badge}
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">
      {d.title}
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-muted max-w-4xl leading-relaxed">
      {d.subtitle}
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Simulator Layout (2 Columns) -->
  <main class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    <!-- Controls (Left 6 Cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="border-b border-hairline/60 pb-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" />
          </svg>
          {d.controlsTitle}
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.controlsSub}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Presets Selector -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <label class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted block">
          {d.presetsTitle}
        </label>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <button type="button" id="btn-preset-pea" class="text-left p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-emerald-500/5 transition text-xs font-medium text-ink">
            🌱 {d.presetPeaProtein.split('(')[0]}
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-preset-oat" class="text-left p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-emerald-500/5 transition text-xs font-medium text-ink">
            🌾 {d.presetOatBetaGlucan.split('(')[0]}
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-preset-antho" class="text-left p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-emerald-500/5 transition text-xs font-medium text-ink">
            🫐 {d.presetAnthocyaninCollagen.split('(')[0]}
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-preset-probiotic" class="text-left p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:bg-emerald-500/5 transition text-xs font-medium text-ink">
            🥛 {d.presetProbioticCereal.split('(')[0]}
          </button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="btn-preset-hazard" class="w-full text-left p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-rose-800/40 bg-rose-950/20 hover:bg-rose-950/40 transition text-xs font-medium text-rose-300">
          ⚠️ {d.presetHazard.split('(')[0]}
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Parameter Inputs -->
      <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
        <!-- System Architecture -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <label for="input-system" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink flex justify-between">
            <span>{d.systemLabel}</span>
          </label>
          <select id="input-system" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-ink focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500">
            {scfxData.systemArchitectures.map(s => (
              <option value={s.id}>{s.name}</option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.systemHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feedstock Biomaterial -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <label for="input-feedstock" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink flex justify-between">
            <span>{d.feedstockLabel}</span>
          </label>
          <select id="input-feedstock" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-ink focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500">
            {scfxData.bioproductFeedstocks.map(f => (
              <option value={f.id}>{f.name}</option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.feedstockHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- scCO2 Injection Pressure -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <label for="input-pressure" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
              {d.pressureLabel}
            </label>
            <span id="display-pressure" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">180 bar</span>
          </div>
          <input type="range" id="input-pressure" min="80" max="280" step="5" value="180" class="w-full accent-emerald-500 cursor-pointer" />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.pressureHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Melt Temperature -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <label for="input-temp" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
              {d.tempLabel}
            </label>
            <span id="display-temp" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">65 °C</span>
          </div>
          <input type="range" id="input-temp" min="40" max="125" step="1" value="65" class="w-full accent-emerald-500 cursor-pointer" />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.tempHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- scCO2 Dosing Percentage -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <label for="input-co2-dose" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
              {d.co2DoseLabel}
            </label>
            <span id="display-co2-dose" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">2.0 wt%</span>
          </div>
          <input type="range" id="input-co2-dose" min="0.2" max="3.5" step="0.1" value="2.0" class="w-full accent-emerald-500 cursor-pointer" />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.co2DoseHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Screw Speed RPM -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <label for="input-screw-speed" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
              {d.screwSpeedLabel}
            </label>
            <span id="display-screw-speed" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">280 RPM</span>
          </div>
          <input type="range" id="input-screw-speed" min="100" max="450" step="10" value="280" class="w-full accent-emerald-500 cursor-pointer" />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.screwSpeedHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feed Moisture Content -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <label for="input-moisture" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
              {d.moistureLabel}
            </label>
            <span id="display-moisture" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">24.0 %</span>
          </div>
          <input type="range" id="input-moisture" min="15.0" max="30.0" step="0.5" value="24.0" class="w-full accent-emerald-500 cursor-pointer" />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.moistureHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Die Pressure Drop Rate dP/dt -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <label for="input-dpdt" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
              {d.dpdtLabel}
            </label>
            <span id="display-dpdt" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">3.2 GPa/s</span>
          </div>
          <input type="range" id="input-dpdt" min="1.0" max="5.0" step="0.1" value="3.2" class="w-full accent-emerald-500 cursor-pointer" />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.dpdtHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Closed-Loop scCO2 Recovery Checkbox -->
        <div class="pt-2">
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface hover:bg-surface-elevated cursor-pointer transition">
            <input type="checkbox" id="input-recovery" checked class="w-4 h-4 accent-emerald-500 rounded cursor-pointer" />
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-ink block">{d.recoveryLabel}</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-muted block mt-0.5">{d.recoveryHelp}</span>
            </div>
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Diagnostics & Results (Right 6 Cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-b border-hairline/60 pb-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
            </svg>
            {d.diagnosticTitle}
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.diagnosticSub}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Primary Indicators Grid (4 Key Cards) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <!-- Sectional Expansion Ratio (SEI) -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-hairline space-y-1">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium block">{d.expansionRatioLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="res-expansion" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400 font-mono">5.4x</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-muted">Target: 4.5–7.0x</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-1.5 mt-2 overflow-hidden">
              <div id="bar-expansion" class="bg-emerald-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all" style="width: 77%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Micro-Cell Nucleation Density -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-hairline space-y-1">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium block">{d.cellDensityLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="res-cell-density" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400 font-mono">5.6 × 10⁷</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-muted">cells/cm³</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-1.5 mt-2 overflow-hidden">
              <div id="bar-cell-density" class="bg-emerald-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all" style="width: 80%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Mean Micro-Pore Diameter -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-hairline space-y-1">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium block">{d.poreDiameterLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="res-pore-diameter" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400 font-mono">36.0 µm</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-muted">&lt; 50 µm Ultra-Fine</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-1.5 mt-2 overflow-hidden">
              <div id="bar-pore-diameter" class="bg-emerald-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all" style="width: 72%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Retained Bioactivity & Antioxidants -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-hairline space-y-1">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium block">{d.retainedBioactivityLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="res-bioactivity" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400 font-mono">98.4%</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-muted">&gt; 95% Target</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-1.5 mt-2 overflow-hidden">
              <div id="bar-bioactivity" class="bg-emerald-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all" style="width: 98%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Secondary Metrics Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-hairline/60 pt-4">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-hairline space-y-1">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-muted block">{d.smeLabel}</span>
            <span id="res-sme" class="text-sm font-bold font-mono text-ink">51.5 Wh/kg</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-hairline space-y-1">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-muted block">{d.viscosityReductionLabel}</span>
            <span id="res-viscosity" class="text-sm font-bold font-mono text-ink">62.4%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-hairline space-y-1">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-muted block">{d.voidFractionLabel}</span>
            <span id="res-void" class="text-sm font-bold font-mono text-ink">81.5%</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Overall Status Banner -->
        <div id="status-card" class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-950/20 space-y-2 transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">{d.overallStatusLabel}</span>
            <span id="status-badge" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-900/60 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-700/50">
              OPTIMAL MICRO-CELLULAR BIOACTIVE SUPERCRITICAL EXTRUSION
            </span>
          </div>
          <p id="status-desc" class="text-xs text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            The extrusion process operates within the optimal supercritical dissolution window. High gas supersaturation and rapid micro-die decompression yield dense closed-cell micro-pores (25–45 µm) with smooth mouthfeel. Melt temperature remains safely below thermal denaturation thresholds, preserving over 98% of heat-sensitive bioactives and nutrients with 60% lower specific mechanical energy (SME) than steam extrusion.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance Badges -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-hairline font-mono text-muted">3-A Sanitary Standard 45-03 & 74-07</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-hairline font-mono text-muted">EHEDG Class I Aseptic</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-hairline font-mono text-muted">ASME Section VIII Div 1 (350 bar)</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-hairline font-mono text-muted">FDA 21 CFR § 111 & § 117 cGMP</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Interactive Diagram Section -->
  <section class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-sm">
    <div class="border-b border-hairline/60 pb-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
        </svg>
        {d.diagramTitle}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.diagramSub}</p>
    </div>

    <!-- SVG Flow Diagram -->
    <div class="w-full overflow-x-auto">
